    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ISRAELI OFFENSIVE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Israeli offensive during the Battle of Beirut (1941) targeted Syrian positions and strongpoints in the Bekaa Valley."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0348-d384050a4c81</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CEASE-FIRE&quot;">
